Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:03.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑衣人》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！可恶的昆虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn bugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,真倒霉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,边界巡警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,衰人尼克 真想不到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Nick the Dick. What a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪儿来的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you coming from, Nick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去柯里纳钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fishing in Cuernavaca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 看看你有什么鱼获{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Let's take a look at your catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他们扔回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've thrown them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收多少钱？每人一百？二百？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you get? 100 bucks a head? 200?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你有储钱请律师！你用的到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope you saved it all for your lawyer. You'll need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给我们处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,移民局第6区的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}INS, Division 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,移民局第6区？没听说过第6区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Division 6? I never heard of Division 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你押在谁身上？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you betting on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough call, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你好吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,婆婆 别担心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到美国{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？诺克里斯？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找工作啊？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 也是吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴在这儿见到你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可砸你的脸吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长得真丑 不是吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你连一句西班牙话都不明白{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a winner here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他人都可以走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车走吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你不能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, you can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我先生 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't "sir" me, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不知道你在跟谁打交道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea who you're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在立刻上车！{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要跟我们的朋友谈谈 你们先走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll chat with our friend. You hit the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续保护我们 不受危险的外来者的骚扰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep on protecting us from the dangerous aliens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听过第6区吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever hear of Division 6?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没有第6区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no Division 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本在胡说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你在不该在的地方 从巴士上掉下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you fell off the bus in the wrong part of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌你一定不是这附近的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you're not from anywhere near here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,米奇 你什么时候出狱的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mikey, when they let you out of jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,政治犯 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Political refugee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知你犯了多少条约？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how many treaties you just violated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1条？- 是7条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One? - Try seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那头给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hand me that head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手和蹼举起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up your arms and flippers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个 - 那个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "That." - That…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是人类 没错 你身上还挂着些内脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was not human. I know. You got some entrails on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都在控制中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The situation's under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留意一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your attention for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我乐意将事情对你们说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这称为记忆清除器 是远方友人送的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is called a neuralizer. It's a gift from friends from out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,红光能隔离…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This red eye isolates…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…脑中电子脉冲 尤其是记忆脉冲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the brain's impulses, specifically the ones for memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这开始…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a splay burn on the perimeter…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,…将方圆80公尺范围内…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with holes at 40, 60, and 80 metres…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不规则的烧焦 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…from right here. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,答案就在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer you're looking for lies right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 到底是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你想像中的一个虚构人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am just a figment of your imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 真是好骗的品种{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, what a gullible breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你们没被炸死真侥幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious. You're lucky to be alive after that blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么爆炸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What blast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,地下煤气管 天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The underground gas main.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,开枪前应注意点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should exercise caution before firing…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在告诉你 尤其是你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'll tell you that now. Especially you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你离开前先到 急诊室检查一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have yourself checked out with EMS before you leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是会有意外的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心有余 K 但是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spirit's willing, Kay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…其他的部分…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but the rest of me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们真漂亮 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're beautiful, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些星辰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不只是光看星星了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never just look anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 我告诉你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, Kay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我会怀念追逐的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I will miss the chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 D…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是纽约警察 别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}NYPD! Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All yours, Edwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动就是站住！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze means stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么回事？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽约会下黑人雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just be raining black people in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽-约-警-察！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-Y-P-D!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这代表了我会扭送你进警察局！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Means I will knock your punk-ass down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了之后 我亦会拘捕他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and when he gets here, I'll arrest his ass too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想被打？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trying to catch a beat-down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在路上了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来是因为我失败了 他亦会杀了我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming because I failed. Now he'll kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天得罪了不少人 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pissing everybody off today, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的世界就快被毁灭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world's gonna end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心会掉下去 小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch that ledge. Watch the ledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来 我们能把眼晴医好的 别担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down. We'll get those eyes fixed, don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 让我跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Let me talk to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累得半死才可以为生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I work my butt off to make a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望能回到一个整洁的家 有顿丰盛的晚餐…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is to come home to a fat steak on the table…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但我却得到这些 看起来像毒药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but instead I get this. It looks like poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拿走！我正在吃呢！这是毒药 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take that away! I'm eating that! It is poison, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果 我一点都不会惊讶…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, I wouldn't be surprised if it was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你像一只被打太多或打的 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the way you skulk like a dog been hit too much, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够的狗一样的闪闪躲躲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or not enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法决定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一点用都没有 碧姿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're useless, Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这唯一可以做点事的东西 就是我的卡车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing that pulls its weight around here is my goddamn truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,早料到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼玩意儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the heck is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你滚进屋里去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your big butt back in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把发射武器放在地上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place projectile weapon on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我丢下枪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can have my gun…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,…除非我死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when you pry it from my dead fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受你的建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your proposal is acceptable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅加 到底是怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edgar, what on earth was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过糖会搞成那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen sugar do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,把糖给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在水里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,多一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的皮快掉下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your skin is hanging off your bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好些吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,「那罪犯眨了两对眼睑」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The perpetrator blinked two sets of eyelids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指两眼一起眨？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blinked with both eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他先眨一对 然后再眨另外一对完全不同的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He blinked one set, then a completely different set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,像高灯和低灯那样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like high beams and low beams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是在你说的那个武器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that before or after he drew the weapon that you claim…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…蒸发成百万片…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…evaporated into a million pieces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}After, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何都没有别的警官 看见这些事件？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it that no other officers saw either of these events?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,部分警察的腰围发胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of them are soggy around the midsection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们赶不上的原因{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't able to keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你是半个男人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were half the man I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是你一半那么胖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am half the man that you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你缠住我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想他把他从屋顶上丢下去 - 真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think he threw him off the roof. - You next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,10分钟 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes, you take your best shot, tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,先运动10分钟 肥仔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take 10 minutes on a StairMaster, you pudgy bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 我是验尸官韦娜璐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you. Laurel Weaver. Deputy Medical Examiner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到验尸房找我 我有证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find me at the morgue. I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是检验无名尸的韦医生？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Dr. Weaver with the coroner's office working on the John Doe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 请看这里 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Will you look at this, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真精彩 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some night, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚真精彩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.41,0:17:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是腮 不是眼睑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gills, not eyelids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,腮 他在喘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gills. He was out of breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟你说了什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说世界末日到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said the world was coming to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有说什么时候吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看到那武器你会认出吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you recognize his weapon if you saw it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 我们去兜风{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's take a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 我有一堆报告要写{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Look, I got tons of paperwork…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,都写好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的是徒步去追那衰人？不简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really ran this dude down on foot? That's tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常不简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's double tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是哪个部门的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who exactly are you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是哪个部门的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who exactly are you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查局？国安局？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI? NSA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们负责监控地球上的外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm part of a bureau that licenses, monitors and polices aliens on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们要去的地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where we're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是积克的店{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Jack Jeebs' spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他卖赃物但是不卖枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He buys from chain-snatchers. Doesn't sell guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.11,0:18:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进去问他几个问题 出来时我要你说实话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go in and put my thing down, but when I come out, I want answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去问他几个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, go put your thing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华警官…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer Eduardo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么会在这？我以为已经交给当局了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did these get here? I thought I turned them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你有比偷来的劳力士更抢手的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you're into something hotter than stolen Rolexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也贩卖毒品 但我喜欢在这儿做生意的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deal crack, but I still work here. I love the hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指的是枪 耍聪明！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about guns, smart-ass! Weird ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼见的 我只有这么些货了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! What you see is what I got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他看进口货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him the imports, Jeebs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kay. How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.02,0:19:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他看进口货 - 我很久没卖进口货了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Show him the imports. - I got out of that business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何骗我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you lie to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.86,0:19:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到3{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll count to three.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会开枪的 这个人看起来不太稳定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll do it, Jeebs. That man does not look stable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙这样是很疯狂的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? He's crazy when he's like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是这样子 去按摩一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always crazy. Get a massage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.45,0:19:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭船旅游…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a cruise…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.12,0:19:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丢下枪 把手放在头上 - 我警告过他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drop the weapon. - I warned him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.67,0:19:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢下枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the weapon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们警告他了 - 我要开枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You warned him. - I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,粗鲁的讨厌鬼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You insensitive jerk!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.18,0:19:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可知那样有多痛吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any idea how much that stings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.93,0:19:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿出货来 否则再补一枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show us the merchandise, or you'll lose another head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱德华先生…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Edwards…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把 中间那把{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, the one in the middle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.58,0:20:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把将反射碳化能量围换枪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sold a reverberating carbonizer with mutate capacity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…卖给没执照的塞波人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to an unlicensed cephalopoid! You piece of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看起来像是好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looked okay to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.80,0:20:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要暗杀的对象是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was for an assassination. The target?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.09,0:20:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可恶！- 我不知道！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goddamn it! - I don't know!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.43,0:20:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部枪都充公{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that's confiscated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搭下班船离开这儿 不然我会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be on the next transport off this rock, or I shoot where it don't grow back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再回来问你劳力士的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna be back to talk about them Rolexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在找问题的症结吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Searching for a handle on the moment?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能做的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only comfort I can offer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.06,0:21:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…保证明天你什么都忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is my promise that tomorrow you won't remember a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.93,0:21:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种事怎么可能说忘就忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not exactly some shit you forget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.81,0:21:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过这东西吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever seen one of these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她望着她丈夫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looks over to her husband…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.49,0:21:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,…把它放在大腿上说：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…then sets it down in her lap and says:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「甜心 它在吃我的爆壳」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}" Honey, this one's eating my popcorn."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.29,0:21:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在吃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's eating…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 谢谢你的春卷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta go. Thanks for the egg rolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.67,0:21:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我对龙舌兰酒的意见了吧？你个聪明的年轻人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See what I mean about tequila? You're very bright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.18,0:21:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要喝太多的酒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need to lay off the sauce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.18,0:22:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一早九点见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you bright and early, 9:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.68,0:22:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.31,0:22:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,…随便你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or be square.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.19,0:22:11.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑超特警组）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.77,0:22:15.96,Note,0,0,0,0,,（贝利街504号）
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管搬进来 不是这样吗？当这是自己的家？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moving right in, are we? Think we own the place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.38,0:22:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有张驱逐通知单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an eviction notice for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.55,0:22:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what exactly do you think you're doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,处理你的害虫问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking care of your pest problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,除虫害？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pest problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.09,0:22:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫害？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿到处是害虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a hell of an infestation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见它们泛滥成灾了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've noticed an infestation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的视线范围内 到处是 浮垢…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere I look, nothing but undeveloped, unevolved…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.81,0:22:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,…让我深信它们这高等族群…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…barely conscious pond scum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.52,0:22:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,…为了它们短暂 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…totally convinced of their own superiority…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.44,0:22:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,而无价值的生命…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as they scurry about their short…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.78,0:22:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,…到处逃窜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…pointless lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.53,0:23:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想除去他们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you wanna get rid of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.62,0:23:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the worst way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.18,0:23:30.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（桥梁隧道管理局）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.16,0:23:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人给我这张名片…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This dude gave me this card…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.12,0:23:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐升降机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.14,0:24:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迟到了 坐下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late. Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.40,0:24:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫Z{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Zed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.28,0:24:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你们来因为你们是佼佼者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all here because you're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.12,0:24:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,海军 空军 海军特种部队 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marines, Air Force, Navy SEALs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.57,0:24:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,军方特击队员 纽约警察{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Army Rangers, NYPD.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.08,0:24:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要选出一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want one of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.79,0:24:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只选一人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.17,0:24:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来 要经由一些简单测试…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will follow is a series of simple tests…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.17,0:24:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,…去测验体力 注意力及精力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for motor skills, concentration, stamina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.47,0:24:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see we have a question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.13,0:24:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 也许已经问过了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, maybe you already answered this but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.97,0:24:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我们为何来这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…why are we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.14,0:24:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,中尉泽克 西点军校优等生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Jensen. West Point graduate with honours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.31,0:24:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来是因为你需要 佼佼者中的精英！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here because you want the best of the best of the best, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.53,0:25:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny, Edwards?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.74,0:25:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这个男孩 美国上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your boy, Captain America, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「佼佼者中的精英」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The best of the best of the best, sir!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.33,0:25:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「而且是优等的」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"With honours."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他兴奋异常…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just really excited…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.83,0:25:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…却不明白所为何来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and has no clue why we're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.17,0:25:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言很好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just very funny to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.00,0:25:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你们都没笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y'all ain't laughing, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.51,0:25:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.06,0:26:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要用这张桌子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna get down on this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.25,0:27:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Edwards, what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.96,0:27:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我迟疑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hesitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.63,0:27:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以知道为什么 要杀小蒂芬妮？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I ask why you felt little Tiffany deserved to die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.60,0:27:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她最具威胁性{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the only one that seemed dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.18,0:27:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,何以见得？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you figure that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.81,0:27:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来想射挂在路灯上的那个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna pop this guy hanging from the light…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.77,0:27:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但是他只是在运动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but he's just working out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.65,0:27:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我在运动时 被逮捕会是什么滋味？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd I feel if somebody bust my ass while I'm on the treadmill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我看到这个在嘶叫的怪物…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I saw this snarling beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.69,0:27:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,…因为看到他手里拿了卫生纸 所以我知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I noticed he had a tissue in his hand and realized…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.99,0:27:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他在打喷嚏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he's not snarling, he's sneezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.28,0:27:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不造成威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no threat there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.87,0:27:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到蒂芬妮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I saw Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:28:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 一个8岁白人的女孩 半夜在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}8-year-old white girl, middle of the ghetto…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.37,0:28:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,…全是怪物的街上 手上拿着量子学书…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…bunch of monsters at night with quantum physics books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.50,0:28:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…她一定有些不好的企图{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She about to start some shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.50,0:28:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种书对她来说太深了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those books are way too advanced for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.30,0:28:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言 她很可疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you ask me, she's up to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.97,0:28:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 关于这点 我觉得你不要这么针对我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd appreciate it if you eased up about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.85,0:28:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要我向她道歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do I owe her an apology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.48,0:28:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少射得很准 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good shot, though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不好管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a problem with authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.62,0:28:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他能徒步追捕塞波人 老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this kid ran down a cephalopoid on foot, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那要很强悍才行的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gotta be tough enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你知道自己做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope you know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:29:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…恭喜 多年的政府训练没有白费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're everything we expect from years of government training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.35,0:29:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位跟我来 最后一项 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll just follow me, we have one more test to administer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.19,0:29:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是视力测验{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An eye exam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.78,0:29:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟什么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1950年左右 政府成立了经费不足的机构…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the 1950s, the government started an underfunded agency…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.04,0:29:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…简单而好笑的目的只是要 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with the laughable purpose of establishing contact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,与外星人取得联系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with a race not of this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位看这仪器末端{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the end of this device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.51,0:29:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了外星人之外 人类都把这当成笑话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone thought the agency was a joke, except the aliens…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但在1961年时 外星人在纽约有首次的接触{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who made contact on March 2, 1961 outside New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一天晚我们有九个人 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were nine of us the first night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,七名特工 一名天文家…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven agents, one astronomer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…及一个迷途的男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and a dumb kid who'd gotten lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.69,0:29:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你给那个高个子献花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought that tall man some flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.15,0:29:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.44,0:29:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是一群银河系的难民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were a group of intergalactic refugees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.03,0:30:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把地球当做无家可归者 的政治庇护所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted Earth as an apolitical zone for creatures without a planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:02.45,Title,0,0,0,0,,你看过《北非谍影》吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever see Casablanca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一样的 只是没有纳粹党{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same thing, except no Nazis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.58,0:30:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同意 而且藏匿了他们降落的证据{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We agreed and concealed all evidence of their landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这些是真的飞碟 世界博览会只是个掩饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So these are real flying saucers and the World's Fair was a cover-up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.30,0:30:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么其他理由在皇后区？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why hold it in Queens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.67,0:30:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年到达的非人类越来越多而且 隐藏在我们之中生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More nonhumans arrive every year and live among us in secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是要改变话题 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to change the subject, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.55,0:30:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最后一次做脑电图是什么时候？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but when was the last time you got a CAT scan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 半年前 是公司规定的 - 你该做另一个预约{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Six months ago. It's company policy. - Make another appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.77,0:30:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉Z我玩得很高兴…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell your boy Zed I had an absolutely wonderful time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.23,0:30:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,…而且要谢谢你 并请告诉我出口在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and thank you for everything, but show me the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要喝咖啡 你要吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'm getting some coffee. You want some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.86,0:30:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.33,0:30:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 K{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.71,0:30:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是不是没咖啡因的？- 是维尼斯肉桂味{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not decaf, is it? - Viennese cinnamon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我只有粉末的奶精了 我最不喜欢那种了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me we only got powdered stuff for cream. I hate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.51,0:30:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's good. Good. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.59,0:31:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相处的愉快吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys getting along all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.93,0:31:04.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作别太辛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't work too hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.27,0:31:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不要咖啡？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure you don't want some coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.73,0:31:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.49,0:31:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上约有一千五百名外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At any given time, there are around 1500 aliens on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.07,0:31:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分居住在曼哈顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them here in Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.28,0:31:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分守规矩 只想谋生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of them are decent. Just trying to make a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 计程车司机？- 不是你所想像的那么多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cab drivers? - Not as many as you'd think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.37,0:31:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数的人类一点也不知道 也不想知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humans, for the most part, don't have a clue. Don't want one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.75,0:31:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很高兴 以为自己掌握一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're happy. They think they have a good bead on things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要保密呢？人们很聪明 可以应付的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are smart. They can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.93,0:31:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人是聪明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A person is smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.30,0:31:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,众人是愚蠢 易慌张 和危险的动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dumb, panicky, dangerous animals, and you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.43,0:31:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,1500年前 每个都人知道…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1500 years ago, everybody knew the Earth was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.81,0:31:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,…地球是宇宙的中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the centre of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.77,0:31:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百年前 每个人都知道地球是平的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}500 years ago, everybody knew the Earth was flat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:32:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分钟前 你知道在地球上只有人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And 15 minutes ago, you knew that people were alone on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.49,0:32:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想明天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what you'll know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.74,0:32:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你会知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么坏处？- 坏处？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the catch? - The catch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.12,0:32:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏处就是你会切断 和人类的接触{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The catch is, you will sever all human contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.87,0:32:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道你存在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody will ever know you exist anywhere…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你考虑到日出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you to sunrise to think it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.89,0:32:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it worth it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.48,0:32:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是值得的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.36,0:32:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…若你够坚强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're strong enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.21,0:33:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, pops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.18,0:33:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要加入…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…因为这儿有更深层的事 会发生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…because there's some next-level shit going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.89,0:33:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先我要你明白某些事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before y'all beam me up, there's a few things to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:34:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 是你选我…你知道我的长处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First off, you chose me, so you recognize the skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想人叫我为小子 明白吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want nobody calling me "son" or " kid" or "sport." Cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.28,0:34:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便 油嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Whatever, slick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.74,0:34:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要告诉你关于你的长处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need to tell you something about all your skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of right now, they mean precisely…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As of right now, they mean precisely…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.95,0:34:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这些家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.47,0:34:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 此行的目的？- 外交任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Purpose of trip? - Diplomatic mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.22,0:34:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,停留时间？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duration of stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.39,0:34:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃午餐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.93,0:34:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有水果或蔬菜吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any fruits or vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.28,0:34:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要远离那家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna stay away from that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.95,0:34:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它脾气很坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's grouchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:34:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,在旅行了17兆里后又在海关 滞留三小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hours in customs after a 17-trillion-mile trip…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.96,0:35:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会让人脾气暴躁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…will make anyone cranky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.67,0:35:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们向政府哪部门报告？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What government branch do we report to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.83,0:35:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 他们有太多问题 - 谁支付这一切？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- None. They ask too many questions. - Who pays for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.63,0:35:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拥有几项仪器的专利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hold patents on a few gadgets we confiscated from out-of-state visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.34,0:35:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术帖 微波炉 抽脂手术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Velcro, microwave ovens, liposuction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.72,0:35:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这装置很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a fascinating gadget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.14,0:35:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久就能取代CD {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll replace CDs soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.13,0:35:18.68,Title,0,0,0,0,,那样我就又能买《白色相簿》了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to buy the White Album again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很好玩 是宇宙翻译机 我们不该有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fun. A universal translator. We're not even supposed to have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.31,0:35:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,人的思想原始得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human thought is so primitive. It's looked upon…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.15,0:35:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…在别的星河认为是 会传染的疾病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…as an infectious disease in some galaxies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.94,0:35:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会使你引以为荣的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of makes you proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.03,0:35:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.95,0:35:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be calm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.45,0:35:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别慌张！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.20,0:35:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.04,0:35:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他点冰吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone get him some ice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.58,0:35:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！它向你飞来时快走开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out! Move! Just move when it's coming at you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.93,0:35:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会赔偿的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll pay for that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在1977年导致纽约大停电{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing caused the 1977 New York blackout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.49,0:36:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是大吸引者的玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practical joke by the Great Attractor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.86,0:36:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought it was funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.87,0:36:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, y'all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.83,0:36:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是意外 对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a accident. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.50,0:36:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察室 我们工作的中心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Observation, the heart of our endeavour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.83,0:36:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来介绍一下 双胞胎 波和卜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet the twins, Blblup and Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.25,0:36:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地图显示地球上 每个外星人的所在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This map shows the location of every alien on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.84,0:36:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些会一直被监视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some are under constant surveillance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.22,0:36:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,荧幕上的全是外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone on those screens is an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.55,0:36:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在公众场合他们很正常 但在私底下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In public, they're as normal as you are, but in private…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.01,0:36:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll get the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.22,0:36:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不合理 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't make any sense, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.89,0:36:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 合情合理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, no, it makes perfect sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.11,0:36:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我三年级时 人人都以为我疯了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In third grade, everyone said I was crazy, but I knew our teacher…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但我知道老师 一定是金星来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…had to be from Venus or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,魏太太其实来自木星的… {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Edelson. Jupiter, actually. Well, one of the moons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.24,0:36:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中之一月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…revolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.37,0:37:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Class…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.16,0:37:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,…安静并请注意！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…be quiet and pay attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.50,0:37:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我要再{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I have to tell you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.33,0:37:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说一次…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…one more time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.42,0:37:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿上吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.46,0:37:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put what on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.92,0:37:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿的最后一套衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last suit you'll ever wear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.94,0:37:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只能穿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will dress only in attire specially sanctioned…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.90,0:37:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,…黑超特警特定的服装{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… by MiB Special Services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要依照我们给你的身分…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll conform to the identity we give you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.45,0:37:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,…到指定地方吃饭 到指定地方居住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… eat where we tell you, live where we tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.87,0:37:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.08,0:37:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你没有任何的身分记号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… you'll have no identifying marks of any kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.83,0:37:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你绝不能突出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will not stand out in any way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.87,0:37:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你整体的形象被塑造成…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your entire image is crafted…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.00,0:37:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…不能留给所遇上的人 任何印象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to leave no lasting memory with anyone you meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.25,0:37:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谣言…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a rumour, recognizable only as…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.88,0:37:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…对人家来说只是似曾相似 又不认得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… deja vu and dismissed\njust as quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.01,0:38:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不存在 甚至没有出生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't exist. You were never born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字是无名氏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anonymity is your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.31,0:38:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不作声是你的语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silence, your native tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不再是制度一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no longer part of the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.48,0:38:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在制度之上 之外 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are above the system. Over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.15,0:38:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,超越了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're "them." We're "they."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.41,0:38:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是黑超特警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Men in Black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.21,0:38:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你的分别就是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what the difference is between you and me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.84,0:38:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我穿起来更好看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make this look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我开车去走走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go for a little ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.34,0:38:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先把你放下 爸爸很快回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put you down here for a minute, and Daddy will be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们可以起程了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, now we're ready to go for a little ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.59,0:39:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去见爸爸的朋友 你会很喜欢他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll meet one of Daddy's friends, and you'll like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.22,0:39:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.85,0:39:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,…被罢免的主管…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bee, we got the deposed sur-prefect of Singalee…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.56,0:39:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,…今晚在波兰外降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…touching down in the forest outside Portland tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.73,0:39:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 类似人类的？- 你想的美 带着海绵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Humanoid? - You wish. Bring a sponge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.57,0:39:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是昨晚留下的红色警告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Red letter from last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.36,0:39:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约上州有未经批准的降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had an unauthorized landing in upstate New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.57,0:39:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 留意此事发展{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your ears open on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.78,0:39:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是主持星际派对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not hosting an intergalactic kegger down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.08,0:39:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人逃走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a skimmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,移民来的外星人越区 是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Landed alien out of zone. Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.09,0:39:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,烈擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redgick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.38,0:40:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能离开曼哈顿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not cleared to leave Manhattan, but he's out of town…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.63,0:40:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但他现时离城 被堵在公路上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…stuck on the New Jersey turnpike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.93,0:40:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不带小子去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take junior with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.89,0:40:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对他来说是热身的好机会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good one for him to warm up on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.26,0:40:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,去对付他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.23,0:40:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们不是主持星际派对」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We're not hosting an intergalactic kegger."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.40,0:40:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.16,0:40:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,全宇宙有无限的科技 而我们却利用这烂车…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unlimited technology from the whole universe, and we cruise around…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.33,0:40:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…来做交通工具{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a Ford POS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑好安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fasten your seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的人际关系还要加强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta work on your people skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.50,0:40:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你礼貌一点 所得的反应会较好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd get a better reaction if you were polite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.46,0:40:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,请绑好安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fasten your seat belt, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你有受伤吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Did you hurt yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.76,0:40:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你千万别碰那红色按钮 小子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The red button there, kid. Don't ever touch the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.44,0:41:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 老爹 七十二元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pop, that'll be $72 there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.74,0:41:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 宝贝 让我付钱给无礼的司机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sweetie, let me pay the impolite driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.73,0:41:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我迟到了 这星球的司机很差{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.23,0:41:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 你很危险{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.86,0:41:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 而且每次都 多收车资{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.11,0:41:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个虫降落了 我们要把你从这星球送走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.20,0:41:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个昆虫？他一定知道我为何会在这{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.66,0:41:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想他是知道的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.71,0:42:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我所想要的吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只是给你孩子的 钻石{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.46,0:42:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有空进食吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.46,0:42:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我已替你点了菜{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.05,0:42:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,六号上菜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six is up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.89,0:42:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾文呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is lvan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.18,0:42:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他休息了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gave him a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.36,0:42:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为亚基伦帝国 继续统治干杯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.66,0:42:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为银河系安全干杯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.92,0:42:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以杀我们 但你找不到银河系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill us both, but you will not find the Galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.92,0:42:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right about one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.48,0:43:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里也不能去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示执照及登记证书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your licence and registration, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示另外那种执照及登记证书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like to see your other licence and registration, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.14,0:43:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只限在曼哈顿活动 你去哪儿 烈擎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're restricted to Manhattan. Where are you going, Redgie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.77,0:43:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我太太 她… 看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my wife. She's… Well, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.11,0:43:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题不大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.53,0:43:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你跟我来 烈擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you come with me, Redge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.82,0:43:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应付这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.16,0:43:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.78,0:44:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只要接就好了 - 他知道他在做什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just catch. - Does he know what he's doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.37,0:44:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 让他做吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does it all the time. Let him work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.17,0:44:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎哟 老天！所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.76,0:44:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西伸出来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's peeking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.68,0:44:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却先往城外去 到底什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're headed out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.89,0:44:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去见别人 - 是谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're meeting someone. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.43,0:44:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是一艘船 - 我今天没有看到有核准离境的资料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a ship. - I saw no departure clearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.69,0:44:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.81,0:44:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是紧急事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.65,0:44:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好 好样的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.19,0:44:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么紧急事？为何突然要离开星球？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of emergency? What's the rush to get off the planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.65,0:44:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是不喜欢 我们的那一区了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't like the neighbourhood anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.07,0:44:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些是新来的人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of the new arrivals…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.16,0:44:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的？和昨晚坠毁的有关吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New arrivals? Have anything to do with the crasher last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.70,0:44:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 小姐！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, miss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.75,0:44:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.79,0:44:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.55,0:44:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.72,0:44:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.05,0:45:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 烈擎 它是个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, Redge. It's a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.10,0:45:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…乌贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…squid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.85,0:45:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他其实是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…非常的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…actually kind of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.03,0:45:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,…可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.08,0:45:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才有什么不正常的地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything about that seem unusual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.88,0:45:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么把他吓成这样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would scare Redgick so badly…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.71,0:45:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,…要带着新生儿去冒险？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that he'd risk a warp jump with a newborn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.63,0:45:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追查资料吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll check the hot sheets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.18,0:45:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,教宗是个父亲 令人震惊的证据在内{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are "hot sheets"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.60,0:45:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是资料？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best investigative reporting on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.89,0:45:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上最佳的调查报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read The New York Times if you want. They get lucky sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.35,0:45:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到你在超市卖的 八卦报导上找线索{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannot believe you're looking for tips in the supermarket tabloids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.57,0:45:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not " looking for."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.94,0:45:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.61,0:46:01.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（外星人偷走了我丈夫的皮囊）
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.33,0:46:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢着 别急 - 为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute, slow down. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.96,0:46:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她点时间让她想歪了 让调查更容易些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her time to get the wrong impression. Makes it smoother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.30,0:46:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何贵干？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.97,0:46:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是联邦调查局的文特警 他是毕特警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am. I'm Agent Manheim, this is Agent Black, FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,想问有关访客的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd like to talk about your visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.47,0:46:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也要拿我开玩笑？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna make fun of me too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.14,0:46:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,调查局的人没有可令人察觉的 幽默感 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we do not have a sense of humour we're aware of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.91,0:46:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以进来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May we come in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.98,0:46:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.32,0:46:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 要柠檬水吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Lemonade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.78,0:46:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.82,0:46:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察局长亲自来这…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chief of police came to the house…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.49,0:46:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…做了一个全面的调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and did an investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.95,0:46:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走警方报告 还写下我说的一切…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took a police report and writ down everything I said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.33,0:46:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但不相信我说的 任何一句话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not believing one thing I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.38,0:46:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还有点在取笑我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of poking fun at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.34,0:46:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们问我 若他被谋杀…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me, " If he was murdered…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.67,0:47:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…怎么能走进屋子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…how was he able to walk back in the house?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.34,0:47:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得承认这把我问倒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta admit to you that that one got me stumped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.59,0:47:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解雅加 那人不是雅加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, I know Edgar, and that wasn't Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.68,0:47:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有东西在穿雅加的身体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like something was wearing Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.64,0:47:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是外衣…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a suit…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.52,0:47:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一件「雅加」外衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…an Edgar suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.53,0:47:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人变外星人前已很丑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude was that ugly before he was an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.16,0:47:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.37,0:47:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.42,0:47:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.83,0:47:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我醒来他己离去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I come to and he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.92,0:47:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说了什么吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He say anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.21,0:47:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 他向我要水喝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. He asked me for some water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.67,0:47:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some sugar water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.88,0:47:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,糖水？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sugar water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.22,0:47:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得 因为很怪异…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember that right. I thought that that was odd…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.60,0:47:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他要糖水而不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that he asked me for sugar water and not lemonade or ice water…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.10,0:47:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…水或自来水…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or regular water…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.60,0:47:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,…水或冰水{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…tap water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.94,0:48:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 碧姿 没有外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Beatrice. There was no alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.86,0:48:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那道闪光不是飞碟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The flash of light was not a U.F.O.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.40,0:48:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是上升煤气团被金星反射{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas was trapped in a thermal pocket and refracted the light from Venus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.95,0:48:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.45,0:48:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你洗掉她记忆再编个新的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing erases her memory, and you just make up a new one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.12,0:48:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是记忆清除器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A standard-issue neuralizer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.00,0:48:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你编那么烂的故事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That weak-ass story is the best you came up with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.04,0:48:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 附加说明…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. On a more personal note…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.84,0:48:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,…雅加跟他前任女友跑了 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Edgar ran off with an old girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.99,0:48:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搬去跟你妈住一阵就好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll stay with your mama…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.09,0:48:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得这样会更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and decide you're better off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.72,0:48:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他对你那么坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because he never appreciated you anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.97,0:48:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.14,0:48:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你甩了他 他走了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kicked him out. And now that he's gone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.10,0:48:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你可以买漂亮衣服{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you'll go in town, find yourself some nice dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.48,0:48:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,买双鞋 也许去做面部按摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself some shoes. Find somewhere you could get a facial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.11,0:48:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…快找人来重新装修 这儿很不济{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hire a decorator to come in here quick because… damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.54,0:48:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我何时才能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do I get my own flashy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.58,0:48:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,…有记忆清除器？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…memory messer-upper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.21,0:49:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你长大之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you grow up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.34,0:49:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托不要是绿色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Not green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.80,0:49:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.51,0:49:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道哪种 外星人是流绿汁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know which alien leaves a green spectral trail…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.60,0:49:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…喝糖水的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and craves sugar water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.93,0:49:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是昨晚机智问答的题目 答案是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was on Jeopardy last night. Damn, Alex said it was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.02,0:49:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Z 虫族入侵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zed, we have a bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.57,0:49:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是… 我们不喜欢虫族？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So… What? We don't like bugs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.57,0:49:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族制造大屠杀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bugs thrive on carnage, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.20,0:49:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们消耗 骚扰其他种族…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They consume, infest, destroy, live off the death of other species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.78,0:49:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你童年时被虫咬过？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were stung as a child, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.45,0:49:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想像一个超大蟑螂 它力大无穷…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine a giant cockroach with unlimited strength…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,…劣等生物本性 易怒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…a massive inferiority complex, and a real short temper…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.13,0:49:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,…穿雅加的皮横行曼哈顿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is terrorizing Manhattan Island in a new Edgar suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.59,0:49:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来有趣吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sound like fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.14,0:49:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该怎么做？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.39,0:49:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要虫族在城里 我们就要去殓房监视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a bug in town, we'll watch the morgues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.19,0:50:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,3号尸体要放哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you want contestant number 3?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.24,0:50:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在那就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.99,0:50:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猫怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with the cat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.32,0:50:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只猫有个麻烦 在这签名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a problem with the cat. Sign here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.62,0:50:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么麻烦？- 你的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the problem with the cat? - It's your problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.75,0:50:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌活人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.30,0:50:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.33,0:50:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我的老天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.29,0:51:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 你是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, what are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.68,0:51:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,解剖时尸温约112华氏度…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subject was approximately 112 degrees at time of autopsy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.18,0:51:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,…表示体温上升了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…indicating a temperature increase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.60,0:51:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,验尸者想由直肠量体温 却找不到直肠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Examiner tried to verify this rectally, but the subject had no rectum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.98,0:51:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这情况真…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is really…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.65,0:51:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.40,0:51:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是卫生署的文医生 与白医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Leo Manville, Department of Public Health. This is Dr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.61,0:51:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定没有家庭生活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must not have a home life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.86,0:51:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最近在监视这殓房 近来有何异常状况？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We watch the morgues carefully. You have something unusual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.37,0:51:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 三重凶杀案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say so. Triple homicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.91,0:51:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个还算正常 除了被折成两半之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first body was normal, except he was broken in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.79,0:51:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个还算正常 除了被折成两半之外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first body was normal, except he was broken in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.33,0:51:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我解剖了另两个尸体…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when I opened up the other two, well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.08,0:51:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带你去看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.97,0:51:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的骨骼架构有异于常人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a skeletal structure unlike anything I've seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.35,0:51:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我查看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.01,0:52:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去查看另一个尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Dr. Weaver check the other body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.43,0:52:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,往这边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.52,0:52:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个更怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's even stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.31,0:52:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做腹部解剖 我由胃开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a laparotomy. I started with the stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.23,0:52:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以由食道开始 或看你想从哪里开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can start with the gastroesophageal junction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.82,0:52:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就照你的方法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's start wherever you started at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.20,0:52:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okey-dokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.25,0:52:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的猫？- 现在是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this your cat? - It is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.04,0:52:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着尸体来的 探手进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came in with the body. Dive right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.63,0:52:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会在意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure he won't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.97,0:52:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼神很迷人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have really pretty eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.85,0:52:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.68,0:52:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.81,0:52:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸到幽门了？推过一旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the pyloric junction would be? Push it aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.36,0:52:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么不对？胃 肝 肺…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice anything strange? Stomach, liver, lungs…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.78,0:52:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 都很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, all fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.90,0:52:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,器官都不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.16,0:52:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.28,0:53:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我首先便注意到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's obviously the first thing I noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.78,0:53:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是说 里面没有…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I was pointing out is the fact that there are no…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.96,0:53:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,…碎片…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…pieces…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.54,0:53:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,…存在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…of them left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.29,0:53:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 那些器官都…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, so they're intact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.80,0:53:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是完整的不见了… …是肯定的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wherever they are whole. That we can be sure of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.13,0:53:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见过吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we met before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.38,0:53:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个似曾相识的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a feeling of dejavu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.97,0:53:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, me too. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.10,0:53:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我在想什么吗？但别告诉他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna know what I think? Don't tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.81,0:53:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他太紧张了 我认为那不是尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's under enough stress. I don't think it's a real body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.40,0:53:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为这是种运输工具 或是类似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's some kind of transport unit for something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.98,0:53:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.70,0:53:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是不是把你吓坏了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this freaking you out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.24,0:53:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.04,0:53:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道有时候我想做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I like to do sometimes when it's late?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.33,0:53:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.34,0:53:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,白医生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.42,0:53:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.47,0:54:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.18,0:54:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣 她很喜欢死人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting. She got a "Queen of the Undead" thing going…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.64,0:54:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指「身体」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.14,0:54:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,身材很劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.19,0:54:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.69,0:54:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好去看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to look at that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.98,0:54:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,认得他吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recognize him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.11,0:54:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在总部见过他 只是更死像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks like the big guy I saw at headquarters, only deader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.86,0:54:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么杀了他？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What killed him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.49,0:54:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bug?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.33,0:54:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在叫你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up, slugger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.66,0:54:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.67,0:54:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.65,0:54:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.73,0:54:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prevent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.15,0:55:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…争夺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…contest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.11,0:55:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.82,0:55:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prevent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.49,0:55:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prevent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.29,0:55:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…挣扎？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…struggle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.75,0:55:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,…避免…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prevent…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.33,0:55:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}War?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.63,0:55:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.42,0:55:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Galaxy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.34,0:55:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.51,0:55:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,…猎户座的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Orion's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.93,0:55:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,…带…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…be…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.68,0:55:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.77,0:55:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,床？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.60,0:55:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带？猎户座星带？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Belt? Orion's belt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.88,0:56:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,「避免战争 银河系在猎户座星带上」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To prevent war, the Galaxy is on Orion's belt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.51,0:56:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.89,0:56:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个叫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.60,0:56:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…什么的 过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…whatever, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.18,0:56:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫什么的？你们不是卫生署派来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Whatever? You guys aren't really from the Department of Health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.48,0:56:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛辛保！可恶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosenberg. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.56,0:56:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚基伦人不会喜欢这个 他是皇族的成员之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arquillians won't like this. He was one of the royal family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.19,0:56:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是外星人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an alien…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.61,0:56:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你们是政府官员 来掩饰实情的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and you're from a government agency keeping it under wraps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.16,0:56:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说避免战争 银河系在猎户座星带上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "To prevent war, the Galaxy is on Orion's belt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.66,0:56:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了 你要怎么解释纽约？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else do you explain New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时在计程车 这个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in this cab, and this guy was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.33,0:56:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系在猎户座星带上 听起来没道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Galaxy on Orion's belt" makes no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.67,0:56:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大头里的小人是这么说 对吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the little dude inside the big dude's head said, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.84,0:56:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！你洗掉了她的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, man! You did the flashy thing already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.05,0:56:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论你们是谁 出示身份证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are, you'll have to show me I.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.89,0:56:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 小姐 请看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, young lady. Look at this for me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.18,0:56:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别再闪了 好吗？- 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you stop that? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.22,0:56:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个会害她得脑癌的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing will give her brain cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.60,0:56:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没被伤害过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never hurt her before. Close the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.10,0:57:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,特勤组快到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Services will be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.15,0:57:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闪了那可怜的女人几次？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have you flashy-thinged that woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.28,0:57:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,两次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.36,0:57:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不担心造成长期影响？- 有一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't you worry about long-term damage? - A little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.86,0:57:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你闪过我吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you flashy-thinged me? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.03,0:57:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的！有没有闪过我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't playing with you! Have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.13,0:57:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后清除记忆的事交给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I should be in charge of the flashy thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.42,0:57:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not while I'm around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.09,0:57:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会烧坏别人的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll fricassee someone's brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.55,0:57:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个死了的外星人而且 验尸官需要新记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got two dead aliens and a medical examiner needs a new memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.14,0:57:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她个快乐的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it a happy memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.72,0:58:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它到底在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.60,0:59:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 Z…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Zed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…这里的人都不睡觉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't anybody ever get any sleep around here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.65,0:59:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,孪生子让我们守圣塔伦时间 那一天有37小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The twins keep us on Centurian time. It's a 37-hour day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.77,0:59:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,过几个月就会习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a few months. You'll get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.28,0:59:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你会精神错乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or have a psychotic episode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.40,0:59:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是猎户座{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's Orion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.74,0:59:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是北方天空最亮的星群{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a grouping of the brightest stars in the northern sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.99,0:59:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是猎户星带 - 那个小人就是这么说：{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here's Orion's belt. - The little guy said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.83,0:59:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,「避免战争 银河系在猎户座星带」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To prevent war, the Galaxy is on Orion's belt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.41,0:59:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 猎户星带上没银河系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no galaxies on Orion's belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.92,0:59:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,星带就是这3颗星 银河系是很大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The belt is just these three stars. Galaxies are huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.84,0:59:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几十亿颗星 你听错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're made up of billions of stars. You heard wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.84,0:59:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你说 我知道我听到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, whatever, I know what I heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.42,1:00:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.22,1:00:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟老头的故事渐渐的显现了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That grumpy guy's story's starting to come into focus a little bit here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.52,1:00:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,献花给外星人的人就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you were the guy in that picture with the flowers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.69,1:00:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜她一直没收到花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I take it, she never got those flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.74,1:00:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她结婚了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, she ever get married or anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.82,1:00:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人说 轰轰烈烈的爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say it's better to have loved and lost…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.95,1:00:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…胜于没爱过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…than never to have loved at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.33,1:00:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你试试{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.09,1:00:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.46,1:00:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都在离境{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.17,1:01:00.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚逃走了12个人 烈擎打头阵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had 12 jumps in the last hour. Redgick was just the first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.97,1:01:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们获悉什么 我们不知道的情报？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they know that we don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.01,1:01:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,老鼠为何弃船而逃？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does a rat desert a ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.76,1:01:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看4号卫星显示 质子热感应显像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me Lem Sat 4, please, with a proton induction thermoscan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.44,1:01:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 18号卫星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Okay. Lem Sat 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.82,1:01:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 4000号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, 4000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.41,1:01:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是亚基伦战舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Arquillian battle cruiser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.12,1:01:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而亚基伦王子死在地球上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've got a dead Arquillian prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.58,1:01:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这个恶棍…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.12,1:01:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来他们气坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They sound pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.29,1:01:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快翻译出来 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Translate that. Step on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.13,1:01:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,去洛辛保珠宝店搜一搜 看能找出什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Rosenberg's jewellery store, and see what you can turn up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.59,1:01:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他个武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the kid a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.69,1:01:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 原子4号枪 - 就是我要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Series 4 De-atomizer. - That's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.15,1:01:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蟋蟀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noisy Cricket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.94,1:02:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 不 别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, no, no, come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.20,1:02:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿原子4号…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a Series 4 De-atomizer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.91,1:02:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,…我拿小蟋蟀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…I get a little midget Cricket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.79,1:02:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉上一捏就碎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel like I'm gonna break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.13,1:02:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的卡车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this is my truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.51,1:03:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得领车时跟他们说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you tell them that down at the impound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.97,1:03:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.36,1:03:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁闯入珠宝店却不偷珠宝？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who breaks into a jewellery store and leaves the jewels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.07,1:03:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要找的不是珠宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody not looking for jewellery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.49,1:03:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙真爱他的猫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy had a serious crush on his cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.58,1:03:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,伏下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.84,1:03:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.76,1:03:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他 是那个虫族！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him. That's the bug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.88,1:03:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿着雅加衣！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the Edgar suit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.95,1:04:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别在众目睽睽下开枪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not discharge our weapons in view of the public!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间讨论这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't got time for this bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.16,1:04:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人的战舰就要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a alien battle cruiser about to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.79,1:04:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有战舰 死光枪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always an alien battle cruiser or a death ray…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.92,1:04:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,…或是银河黑死病入侵地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…or an intergalactic plague about to wipe out life on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.00,1:04:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类快乐过日子因为…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way people get on with their happy lives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.13,1:04:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,…他们并不知情！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is they do not know about it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.60,1:04:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心那只虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't worry about the bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.81,1:04:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走不了 船在我们手上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not leaving town. We got his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.03,1:04:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,派封锁队来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a containment crew…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.24,1:04:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…到麦道格街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… on MacDougal Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.74,1:04:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,封锁是个好主意了 但外星人还在继续离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Containment may be a moot point. The exodus continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.62,1:04:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是舞会结束了 最后走要的付帐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The party's over, and the last one to leave gets stuck with the check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.71,1:05:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘恩负义的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sorry little ingrates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.26,1:05:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那亚基伦战舰呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the Arquillians?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.18,1:05:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻出部分的讯息是：交出银河系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've translated part of the message: " Deliver the Galaxy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.85,1:05:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要得不多 不是吗？- 有更好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They don't want much, do they? - Oh, it gets better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.31,1:05:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要我们负责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hold us responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.12,1:05:25.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（黑超特警交出银河系）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.74,1:05:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把死人放在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you keep your dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.95,1:05:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有死人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have any dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.28,1:05:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.62,1:05:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.45,1:05:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在市殓房吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city morgue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.46,1:05:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些3张1块钱 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's three for a dollar, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.47,1:05:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为金星的光反射在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was some light that refracted off of Venus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,…沼泽气上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…into some swamp gas…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.39,1:05:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,…所以会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and that's what made the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.14,1:05:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 小子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.35,1:06:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,失陪 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.02,1:06:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚基伦人要银河系 不管那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arquillians want the Galaxy, whatever that means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.90,1:06:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要精通银河系的专家帮忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need help, a professional…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.98,1:06:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,…一个对星际政治有经验的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…with years of experience in intergalactic politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.40,1:06:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望那家伙还没离城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope the little twerp hasn't skipped town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.45,1:06:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家聚到这里…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll gather over here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.53,1:06:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚到这里 再近一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, move in closer. That's good. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.16,1:06:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家看这里 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you look right here, I'd appreciate it. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.68,1:06:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装真差 一看就是外星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The worst disguise ever. He's definitely an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.68,1:06:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢？谁在乎啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't like it, you can kiss my furry butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.14,1:06:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Busy, Frank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.27,1:06:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉没空 我的太空船要开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't talk now. My flight's leaving in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.65,1:06:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your paws off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.90,1:06:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫捕狗队来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the pound!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.36,1:06:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗欠我朋友钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dog owes my friend money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.69,1:06:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于亚基伦和虫族 你知道什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arquillians and bugs, what do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.53,1:06:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 不知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nothing. - Not a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.70,1:07:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 停！好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, stop, stop it! Okay, okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.62,1:07:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛辛保不只是亚基伦人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosenberg wasn't a two-bit Arquillian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.00,1:07:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是银河系的管理人 他以为在地球会安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was the guardian of the Galaxy. He thought he'd be safe on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.58,1:07:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族有另外的计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bug had other plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.75,1:07:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系是宇宙次原子能源 的最好来源{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Galaxy is the best source for subatomic energy in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.88,1:07:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,若虫族取得 亚基伦人就完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the bugs get it, kiss the Arquillians goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.88,1:07:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,问星带的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask about the belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.18,1:07:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说银河系在猎户座星带上 是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosenberg mentioned Orion's belt. What did he mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.10,1:07:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 考倒我了 - 考倒你了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Beats me. - Beats you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.68,1:07:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别摇了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.77,1:07:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在练习腹语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ventriloquist act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.06,1:07:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系在这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Galaxy is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.78,1:07:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.82,1:07:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系十亿颗星怎会在这里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A galaxy's millions of stars and planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.65,1:07:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们什么时候才了解到 尺寸不是问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you learn that size doesn't matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.62,1:07:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的东西也可以很小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something's important, it doesn't mean it's not small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,多小？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How small?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.20,1:07:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,像弹珠或珠宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The size of a marble or a jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.79,1:07:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我要在赶太空船之前走一走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. I gotta be walked before my flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.71,1:07:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.13,1:07:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河系在这 不是在猎户座星带上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Galaxy's here, it's not on Orion's belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.78,1:08:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想引人注意…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you want attention…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.28,1:08:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎户座{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.32,1:08:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好听的名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pretty name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.62,1:08:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.63,1:09:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 很好 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, good, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.01,1:09:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你确定铃没坏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for making sure the bell works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.81,1:09:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,农夫 有什么事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, Farmer John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.06,1:09:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个人来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man came in here earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.23,1:09:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个死人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.31,1:09:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我何干？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means what to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的好友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a very dear friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.90,1:09:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有只动物跟他一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe he had an animal with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.24,1:09:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我送他的礼物 一只猫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift I gave him. A pet cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.03,1:09:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说非常的重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means worlds to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.91,1:09:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to have it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.91,1:09:54.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要身份证… …宠物拥有人证明…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll need picture I.D., proof of ownership of the cat…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.63,1:09:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,…与死人亲属关系 的公证证明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…notarized proof of kinship with the deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.09,1:10:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.26,1:10:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.51,1:10:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.60,1:10:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.66,1:10:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 交给我就行了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Kay, let me handle this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.16,1:10:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是抓猫 不难的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we gotta do is get a cat. It's not that hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.12,1:10:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你进去 你又会对她闪个不停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you go in there, you'll start flashing your brain ray in her face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.62,1:10:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,会害她得血癌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll wind up with leukemia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.54,1:10:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生不需要你把她学的都洗掉 我只要五分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor don't need you flashing away her med-school classes. Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.63,1:10:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.47,1:10:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只猫呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the animal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.76,1:10:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.43,1:10:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see if we can find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.15,1:10:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.53,1:11:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.08,1:11:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing? - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.87,1:11:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是弗莱迪警官 26支局来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sergeant Friday from the 26th Precinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.04,1:11:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,有只猫跟尸体一起被送来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cat came in with a corpse the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.88,1:11:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 名牌上是写着猎户座 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Orion" on the nametag? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.80,1:11:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只猫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this cat is a witness…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.01,1:11:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,…是谋杀案…的证人 我要带它走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in a murder case. I'll need to take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.72,1:11:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道猫在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where the cat is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.55,1:11:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.39,1:11:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你可以带我跟你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but maybe you could take me with you instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.10,1:11:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真主动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, you do start fast, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.31,1:11:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的想跟你走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd really like to go with you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.44,1:11:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,…就是现在！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.40,1:11:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And exactly why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.08,1:11:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to show you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.87,1:12:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不可以这么快！- 你没搞明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Girl, don't hit the gas like that! - You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.38,1:12:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要看这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.88,1:12:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会 只有一件事 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. One thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.64,1:12:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来驾车 这不是雄纠纠的任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta drive. It's not some macho trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.68,1:12:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在说这是我的习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the way I get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.23,1:12:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,色鬼 你没搞懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, stud, you're really not getting this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.07,1:12:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮助我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I need you to help me with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.12,1:12:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.46,1:12:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真迟钝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are thick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.75,1:12:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.09,1:12:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得还不够清楚？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I have to sing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.59,1:12:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像在勾引我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were like a drunk prom date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.38,1:12:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的！女人显示出性独立…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical. Anytime a woman shows even a hint of sexual independence…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.47,1:12:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.51,1:12:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她 吃屎的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.55,1:12:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好 猴仔…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, monkey-boy…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.60,1:12:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,…跟你比起来我们进化多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…l'm on the top rung of the evolutionary ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.06,1:12:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.39,1:13:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看你的脸 然后我会把你的病治好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me your face, and I'll cure your ills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.19,1:13:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔过苍蝇的翅膀吗？想过苍蝇会报仇吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever pull wings off a fly? Care to see the fly get even?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.77,1:13:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的船呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about your ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.44,1:13:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没太空船 已经被没收了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that's what you call that trash we got locked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.61,1:13:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放下武器！- 休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put your weapons down! - Won't happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.24,1:13:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.37,1:13:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会没关系？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.16,1:13:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说将会没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying it's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.50,1:13:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太肯定 混球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bet on it, meat sack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.17,1:13:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.69,1:13:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.94,1:13:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.48,1:13:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.78,1:13:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.67,1:14:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上了计程车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in a cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move! Don't move! Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.91,1:14:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 这位先生 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.63,1:14:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭计程车逃不出地球 走！跟我来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not leaving the planet in a cab. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.43,1:15:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动曼哈顿侦测网{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put up a bionet all the way around Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.35,1:15:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是人类就别想离开！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not human, it doesn't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.02,1:15:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚基伦战舰怎么说？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we hear from upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.85,1:15:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样 交出银河系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}" Deliver the Galaxy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.31,1:15:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,虫族拿走银河系 但我们有他的船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bug's got the Galaxy, but we got his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.48,1:15:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告！质子武器威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning: Plutonic fusion detection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.91,1:15:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,质子武器开动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning: Plutonic fusion detection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.95,1:15:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么开枪打我们？- 亚基伦战争规则 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why are they shooting at us? - Battle rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.75,1:15:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们下了最后通牒 然后示警弹 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get an ultimatum, a warning shot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.09,1:15:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后要在银河1周时间回覆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then a galactic week to respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.59,1:15:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河1周是多久？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A galactic week? How the hell long is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.38,1:15:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,1小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.84,1:15:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,1小时？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.55,1:15:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.97,1:15:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗屎！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.39,1:15:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了不让虫族得手 亚基伦人会毁了它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To keep the bugs from getting it, Arquillians will destroy that galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.60,1:15:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和它所在的星球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever planet it's on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.23,1:15:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指的是我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.94,1:15:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很讨厌吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.95,1:16:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索1百里以内的太空船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the location of every interstellar vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.95,1:16:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜过了 法兰克搭上最后一艘船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already did. Frank took the last ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.37,1:16:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史尼登机场与史龙码头 - 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sneden's Landing and Throg's Neck. - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.79,1:16:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大西洋城 - 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about Atlantic City? - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.83,1:16:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴瑞欧站？- 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bayonne? - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.50,1:16:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有三里岛 - 走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's Three Mile Island. - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.29,1:16:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 史坦登岛！- 走了 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Staten Island? - Gone, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.80,1:16:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间紧迫虫人若离开…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time. If that bug gets off Earth, we're bug food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.93,1:16:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！老头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, old guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.10,1:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还能用吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do those still work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.20,1:16:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟我来 - 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're coming with me. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.79,1:16:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,长途飞行 我要点心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a long trip. I'll need a snack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.67,1:16:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要走隧道？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tunnel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.88,1:16:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有别条路到皇后区？- 隧道会塞车！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know a better way to Queens? - It'll be packed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.05,1:17:02.04,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皇后区隧道）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.19,1:17:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得红色按纽吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the red button?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.11,1:17:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,按红色按纽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.57,1:17:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好绑安全带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put on a seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.45,1:17:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太紧张了 年轻人放轻松{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're much too tense. You're young. Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.33,1:17:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 享受工作上的乐趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take some joy in your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.33,1:17:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢音乐吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.82,1:17:37.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（猫王）
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.67,1:17:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.37,1:18:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道猫王己死了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do know Elvis is dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.21,1:18:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 猫王没死 他回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Elvis is not dead. He just went home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.10,1:18:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想吃我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna eat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.89,1:18:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是地球上的重要人物 我是皇后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an important person on my planet. Like a queen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.90,1:18:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女神 大家膜拜我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A goddess, even. There are those who worship me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.98,1:18:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想让你知道 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not trying to impress you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.99,1:18:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会引起战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying it could start a war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.28,1:18:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争才好 我家人就有的吃的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, war. That means more food for my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.07,1:18:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部7千8百万的人 有许多张嘴要吃东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All 78 million of them. That's a lot of mouths to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.66,1:18:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好爸爸 但我要留在这！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a wonderful dad, but I'm staying here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.93,1:19:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.35,1:19:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,蟑螂来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roaches check in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.23,1:19:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,休想离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't check out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.28,1:19:33.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告！地球8分钟后毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning: E ight minutes to the destruction of Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.12,1:19:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,8分钟后…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}E ight minutes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.66,1:19:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,…毁灭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}… to destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们用内爆第五级电波{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll use pulsar level five with an implosion factor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.21,1:20:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.26,1:20:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,数到三就射击 一…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shoot the damn thing on the count of three. One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.72,1:20:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,…二…三{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…Two …Three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.65,1:21:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,白痴！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You idiots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.49,1:21:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就不懂！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.53,1:21:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.96,1:21:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.50,1:21:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃奶的蠢货！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're milk-suckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.04,1:21:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.00,1:21:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,几秒钟后你们都不会碍事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few seconds, you won't even be matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.71,1:21:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你因违反星际法被捕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest for violating the Tycho Treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.67,1:21:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出你手上的银河系…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So hand over whatever galaxy you might be carrying…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.68,1:21:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,…然后把手放到头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and put your hands on your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.39,1:22:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把手…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll put my hands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.73,1:22:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,…放到头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…on my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.40,1:22:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,像这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.72,1:22:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不在我的计划中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That did not go the way I planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.06,1:22:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让它上第二条船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him on the second ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.98,1:22:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 别让他离开地球！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about? - Keep him on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.15,1:22:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.73,1:22:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿回我的枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get my gun back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.41,1:22:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 虫人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.49,1:23:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说话！知道我用报纸杀过 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how many of your kind I've swatted with a paper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少像你一样的虫子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a smear on the sports page…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.41,1:23:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你这个黏哒哒的 专吃内脏的寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you slimy, gut-sucking, intestinal parasite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.83,1:23:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.46,1:23:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.10,1:23:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.60,1:23:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃完就想逃？不吃甜品了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna eat and run? What about dessert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.78,1:23:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.62,1:23:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？现在好戏才刚要上场！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going? This party's just getting started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.16,1:23:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.04,1:23:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.38,1:23:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一个方法离开这星球 就是必须经过我这关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way off this planet, and that's through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.38,1:24:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.72,1:24:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你赢了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you running, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.68,1:24:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还站着的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.06,1:24:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 拿来 拿来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, bring it. Bring it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.91,1:25:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那是你的姑妈吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Was that your auntie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.58,1:25:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这表示这是你舅舅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means that's your uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.42,1:25:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们长得都一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all look alike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.05,1:25:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.10,1:25:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大坏虫有颗脆弱的心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big, bad bug got a bit of a soft spot, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.27,1:25:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白的是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't understand why you gotta…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.61,1:25:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你为什么要带人来这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…come down here bringing all this ruckus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.32,1:25:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,制造混乱夺取银河系？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…snatching up galaxies and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.28,1:25:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的态度是不找麻烦 就没麻烦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My attitude is, don't start nothing, won't be nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.67,1:25:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快从我的面前消失 免得麻烦上身{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ease up out of my face before something bad happens to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.42,1:26:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.20,1:26:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉亚基伦人 我们拿到银河系了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the Arquillians we have the Galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.87,1:26:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.33,1:26:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把枪拿回来 是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going to get your gun back, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.71,1:26:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这把枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like this gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.92,1:26:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在里面鬼混 害的我一个人在忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While you was in there playing around, I was doing all the work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.38,1:26:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先用石头打他的头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to bean him in the head with this big rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.59,1:26:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来想用木板打他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna hit him with a 2-by-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.76,1:26:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它踢我 好痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He kicked me. It hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.60,1:26:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿起火来吓他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I got to the fire. I was like that with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.60,1:26:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作第二天表现不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad for your second day of work, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.86,1:27:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我遇过最怪异的情况{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This definitely rates a 9.0 on my weird-shit-o-metre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.61,1:27:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该看看在1968年 麦格逊人迁移时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've been here for the Zeronion migration in 1968.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.99,1:27:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没出生吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you weren't even alive in '68.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.29,1:27:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有趣的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting job you guys have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.06,1:27:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道有规矩…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we got these rules…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.14,1:27:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,…但她协助我们杀了那只虫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but she did help us bust that bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.65,1:27:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不必清除她的记忆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we didn't have to flashy-thing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.98,1:27:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会跟谁说？她成天跟死人为伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Who will she tell? She hang out with dead people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.45,1:27:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是给她的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.32,1:27:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是给我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.33,1:27:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.87,1:27:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't they beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.87,1:28:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,星星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.33,1:28:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很久没观赏 其实它们很…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never look at them anymore, but they actually are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.13,1:28:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,…迷人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.18,1:28:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把你的伙伴吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kay, you're frightening your partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.81,1:28:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在训练接班人 不是拍档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been training a replacement, not a partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.98,1:28:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,K 等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.10,1:28:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一人无法胜任{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot do this job by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.61,1:28:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位！我的寓所离这里很远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, my apartment isn't anywhere near here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.48,1:28:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至不在这个岛上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even on the same island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.03,1:28:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,日期…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Days…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.24,1:28:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,…月份…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…months…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.70,1:28:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,…年份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.20,1:28:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要朝着自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always face it forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.55,1:28:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚从蟑螂肚里出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in an interstellar cockroach's gullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.47,1:28:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是100个最不愿记得的记忆之一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's one of 100 memories I don't want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.98,1:29:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.58,1:29:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.54,1:29:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你不会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.66,1:29:28.30,Note,0,0,0,0,,（底特律汽车向地心引力挑战）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.53,1:29:30.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽约棒球队 内野手说：飞碟害我漏接）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.07,1:29:36.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（一个男人昏迷35年后重回女友怀抱）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.00,1:29:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 J{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey J, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.74,1:29:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Z说索里领事要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The high consulate from Solaxium 9…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.16,1:30:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,…公牛队的票{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…wants seats for the Bulls game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.33,1:30:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知洛曼 他是索里星人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call Dennis Rodman. He's from that planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.17,1:30:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛曼？你在开玩笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rodman? You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.08,1:30:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.71,1:30:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有怎么掩饰嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much of a disguise.{\r}
